PROJECT: LEARNSPHERE
Complete Full-Stack Online Learning Management Platform

Act as a senior full-stack software engineer, software architect, database engineer, UI/UX designer, security engineer, and quality assurance engineer.

Your task is to build a complete, professional, responsive, and functional online learning management platform called LearnSphere.

Tagline: "Learn Smarter. Track Progress. Achieve More."

This project must be a real working web application, not a static website, non-functional prototype, or collection of dashboard screenshots.

The application must have a professional public landing page and three distinct authenticated user experiences:

Student.
Instructor.
Administrator.

Each role must have its own dashboard, navigation, authorized operations, and appropriate database access.

Use Google AI Studio as the development environment and maintain the project in a GitHub repository.

Do not claim that GitHub synchronization, deployment, or database configuration has succeeded unless the relevant operation has actually been completed and verified.

